   Groups: 2 of 2 (local + 1 remote)
   Remote SQL: SELECT cu.id, o.id FROM (public.cu LEFT JOIN ( SELECT (u.c1)::integer AS id, (u.c2)::integer AS cust, NULL::text AS amount, NULL::text AS note FROM UNNEST($1, $2) u(c1, c2)) o ON ((o.cust = cu.id))) WHERE true
   ->  Custom Scan (Kingres Distributed Scan)
         Remote groups: 1
         Remote SQL: SELECT id, cust FROM public.o AS ks_t
         ->  Append
               ->  Seq Scan on o_b0000 o_1
               ->  Seq Scan on o_b0001 o_2
