SELECT pushed('SELECT o.id, it.id FROM o JOIN it ON it.sku = o.amount');
DEBUG:  kingres_shard: no pushdown: the distributed tables are not all joined on their distribution keys (more than one key class)
DEBUG:  kingres_shard: no repartitioned join: the distributed tables are not joined so that one repartition aligns them (the other tables must share one key class and the shipped table must equate a column with it)
 pushed 
